        {
          "text": " Beene Reubeeni omujigaijo gwa Israeli: (ahakuba niwe yaabaire ari omujigaijo, kwonka ahabw'okuhagara ekitabo kya ishe, yaayakwa obukuru bwe, bwaheebwa beene Yosefu mutabani wa Israeli; n'ahabw'ekyo omu kukuratana kw'amaziina tarahandiikirwe omu mwanya gw'obukuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.1",
