              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abareubeeni n'Abagaadi n'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase bakaba baine abashaija amamanzi, abaabaire bahagatira engabo na zaarurara, nibamanya kurwanisa amata, abarwani rukungwa, boona bari obukumi buna n'enkumi ina na magana mushanju na makumi mukaaga, abeeteekateekire kuhurura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.18"
            ]
          }
