        {
          "text": " Ku baabaire nibakirwana nabo, baakwerwa, aba Hagari na boona abu baabaire baine baaheebwayo omu mikono yaabo, ahakuba bakatakira Ruhanga omuri orwo rugamba, yaahurira okweshengyereza kwabo, ahabw'okuba bakamwesiga. ",
