        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi aba nibo baabaire bari bakuru omu maju ga baishenkurubo: Eferi, Iishi, Elieli, Azurieli, Yeremia, Hodavia na Yahudieli, abarwani b'amaani, abashaija rugambwa, abaabaire bari bakuru omu maju ga baishenkurubo. ",
